    {
      "id": "KFYu2XzYTyrRafC7klYnq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 623.3048926299795,
      "y": 46.61513600354198,
      "width": 524.2596435546875,
      "height": 1125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aOG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1246377338,
      "version": 1048,
      "versionNonce": 1762777347,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768767878969,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Agent Registry\n    - agent_id\n    - owner_org_id\n    - image_ref\n    - entrypoint\n    - cpu_limit\n    - memory_limit\n    - allowed_tools\n    - secrets_policy\n    - state (draft | active | disabled)\n\n- Ownership\n    “who controls and is accountable for this agent’s \n    definition and resources” \n    - agent_id\n    - owner_user_id OR owner_org_id\n    - created_at\n    - state\n    - resource_policy\n\n- State Machine\n    \"runtime lifecycle & execution health\"\n    - Draft, Active, Disabled, Error, Deprecated\n    \n- Quotas / Limits\n    - Quotas / limits define the maximum \n    allowed behavior for an agent or user.\n\n- Execution Requests\n    - Execution requests represent \n    a user’s request to run an agent.\n    - Requests can be accepted but delayed\n    - Requests can be rejected\n    - Requests can be retried\n    - Requests can outlive the HTTP call\n\n- Usage & Health Metrics\n    - Usage & health metrics describe \n    what actually happened, \n    aggregated for decision-making.\n    - Total runs per agent (last hour/day)\n    - CPU seconds consumed\n    - Memory peak\n    - Tokens used\n    - API calls made",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Agent Registry\n    - agent_id\n    - owner_org_id\n    - image_ref\n    - entrypoint\n    - cpu_limit\n    - memory_limit\n    - allowed_tools\n    - secrets_policy\n    - state (draft | active | disabled)\n\n- Ownership\n    “who controls and is accountable for this agent’s \n    definition and resources” \n    - agent_id\n    - owner_user_id OR owner_org_id\n    - created_at\n    - state\n    - resource_policy\n\n- State Machine\n    \"runtime lifecycle & execution health\"\n    - Draft, Active, Disabled, Error, Deprecated\n    \n- Quotas / Limits\n    - Quotas / limits define the maximum \n    allowed behavior for an agent or user.\n\n- Execution Requests\n    - Execution requests represent \n    a user’s request to run an agent.\n    - Requests can be accepted but delayed\n    - Requests can be rejected\n    - Requests can be retried\n    - Requests can outlive the HTTP call\n\n- Usage & Health Metrics\n    - Usage & health metrics describe \n    what actually happened, \n    aggregated for decision-making.\n    - Total runs per agent (last hour/day)\n    - CPU seconds consumed\n    - Memory peak\n    - Tokens used\n    - API calls made",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1tC4ddX5rL7lUXxPanOz4",
