      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768768776360,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "“Who can create, search, discover, purchase, \nand access agents.”",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "“Who can create, search, discover, purchase, \nand access agents.”",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uNsT7Aa_UtuI5rf0_JnOG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 770.4348766236577,
      "y": -202.79349830758252,
      "width": 181.27989196777344,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1282697446,
      "version": 717,
      "versionNonce": 1646879131,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768605589060,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\"What should run?\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\"What should run?\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "CvMgdTI3m04IVjWm9ftA_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1342.4883634074015,
      "y": -199.57637461559938,
      "width": 686.6395263671875,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1153107450,
      "version": 1026,
      "versionNonce": 1487883757,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768768493313,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "“Where and how it runs.”\n\n- K8s manifest files(YAML) that define cluster.\n\n- The simplest, most industry-standard \nway to avoid reinventing the wheel.\n\n- Kubernetes acting as the infra control plane, driven by your services.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "“Where and how it runs.”\n\n- K8s manifest files(YAML) that define cluster.\n\n- The simplest, most industry-standard \nway to avoid reinventing the wheel.\n\n- Kubernetes acting as the infra control plane, driven by your services.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "InwIuWyk24_FZ9Ho3Qv7b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2202.3675015959293,
      "y": -199.71958963050088,
      "width": 540.3196411132812,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 942176102,
      "version": 972,
      "versionNonce": 838738662,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768597905841,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "“The isolated environment where agent code executes.”\n\n- Agent runtime executes agent workflows inside \nisolated, ephemeral containers, \nwith scoped secrets injected at execution time.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "“The isolated environment where agent code executes.”\n\n- Agent runtime executes agent workflows inside \nisolated, ephemeral containers, \nwith scoped secrets injected at execution time.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "eSMfcFnORZ6aD8TzZFRTY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1111.8832455822007,
      "y": 1421.9388927937805,
      "width": 824.1392822265625,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1197842150,
      "version": 1069,
      "versionNonce": 1297208909,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768768769107,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "“The durable systems agents interact with.”\n- This is durable infrastructure used by multiple planes, not owned by any single one.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "“The durable systems agents interact with.”\n- This is durable infrastructure used by multiple planes, not owned by any single one.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
